://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101805","id":2602471884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bHpHM","user":{"login":"agshultz","id":34627215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NjI3MjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34627215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz","html_url":"https://github.com/agshultz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agshultz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T13:47:07Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T13:47:07Z","body":"It seems there is some inconsistent behavior, and probably not related to the comment space (## ) as I originally thought. Uploading simple MRP for clarity. \n\nUsing this example I can open the project, open autoload.gd in script editor, and by default hovering over either function reference does not show the expected tooltip - both with and without the space. If I CTRL+S to save the script (despite no changes being made), both tooltips now display as expected.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e963f7ff-dd58-4fad-9216-2a660b81a19a)\n\n[mrp_editor_comments.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18478282/mrp_editor_comments.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602471884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710439386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101805#issuecomment-2710439386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101805","id":2710439386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hjgXa","user":{"login":"Conferencier","id":51924615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI0NjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51924615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier","html_url":"https://github.com/Conferencier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conferencier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T12:35:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T14:25:24Z","body":"I have the same issue. Yesterday I created ## comments in my project and they worked. After reopening my project today they are not working any longer.\n\n> [mrp_editor_comments.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18478282/mrp_editor_comments.zip)\n\nWhen I open your MRP the first time in 4.4.stable both comments work. But after reopening it no more. I didn't do anything, no saving.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6b0389b-0797-4389-b31a-a1b9211aa9c1)\n\n---\n\nI've recreated the MRP, compared all files whose modification date has changed between saving and reopening, and narrowed this issue down.\n\nIf I open this MRP from 4.4.beta1 in 4.4.stable it creates a new file filesystem_cache10. At this point the documentation comments are shown in the tooltips. If I now reopen the MRP - with filesystem_cache10 present - they won't work anymore. If you now delete filesystem_cache10 or delete the last two lines (autoload.gd..., mrp.gd...) therein, the documentation comments will work again. But only for the next single opening of the MRP until Godot recreates filesystem_cache10.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710439386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711024289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101805#issuecomment-2711024289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101805","id":2711024289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hlvKh","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u